; Publish after the discovery documents and HTTP headers are deployed.
; Enable DNSSEC at the DNS provider and publish its generated DS at the registrar.
; ARD catalog locator: https://github.com/ards-project/ard-spec
_catalog._agents.uma.moe. 3600 IN TXT "url=https://uma.moe/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"

; Experimental DNS-AID organization index (draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid-02).
; key65400 is a PRIVATE-USE prototype mapping for the well-known path, NOT
; an assigned standard parameter. Consumers need to agree on that mapping.
; Replace it with the registered parameter when the draft is standardized.
; This advertises an HTTPS catalog, not an MCP or A2A server.
_index._agents.uma.moe. 3600 IN SVCB 1 uma.moe. alpn="h2" port=443 key65400="/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"
